Third-party models
------------------
Cloakix does not bundle model weights. When the optional NER feature is used,
the following models are downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub at the pinned revisions:

* CAMeL-Lab/bert-base-arabic-camelbert-mix-ner
  CAMeL Lab, New York University Abu Dhabi. Apache License 2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/CAMeL-Lab/bert-base-arabic-camelbert-mix-ner

* dslim/bert-base-NER
  David S. Lim. MIT License.
  https://huggingface.co/dslim/bert-base-NER

Their licenses apply to those models.
